HASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that transitions a shipment from `CREATED` to `CONFIRMED` status, allows idempotent retries, rejects cancelled shipments with 409, and rejects unknown shipments with 404.\n\nChanged:\n- `ApiError.kt`: Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` error code to handle 409 responses for invalid state transitions\n- `ShipmentController.kt`: Added `confirm()` endpoint that handles all four scenarios (create→confirm, retry, cancelled rejection, not found)\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt`: Added 4 test methods covering all scenarios (CREATED→CONFIRMED transition, idempotent retry, CANCELLED rejection, unknown shipment rejection)\n\nTests:\n- `confirms a created shipment and moves it to confirmed status`: Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and 200 OK response\n- `confirms an already confirmed shipment and succeeds without change`: Verifies idempotency (retry succeeds without state change)\n- `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error`: Verifies 409 response with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS code\n- `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error`: Verifies 404 response with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory. Result: 17 tests passed (5 existing + 4 new confirm tests + 8 other tests), 0 failures, BUILD SUCCESS.\n\nNot done: Nothing. All requirements implemented, tested, and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1944,"cache_read_input_tokens":26083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1944},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79148dae-5314-4179-939e-88ade1933876","uuid":"2fc2f2ae-a04b-4579-aaab-0cc6eb3ad750","timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:09:30.064Z","requ